5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's get this started. Since we're all in the dark, I suggest we keep our observations sharp. I'm interested to see who tries too hard to lead and who stays too quiet. Your move, everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with Shunichi. It is best to remain calm and observe how everyone carries themselves. Let us see who reveals their nature through their words first.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! I think it's a great idea to be observant, but let's also try to be friendly and open so we can trust each other! What do you think?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't see why we have to be so cautious already. Being ""observant"" just sounds like a fancy way of saying you're all suspicious of me! I'm just here to win, okay?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a gentle approach is best. Let us simply listen to one another and see where the truth leads us in due time.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, your enthusiasm is a bit loud for a game of deception, isn't it? @Takumi, getting defensive this early is a classic tell. Let's see if that volatility continues or if it was just a first-turn fluke.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, now, Shunichi. Let's not jump to conclusions so quickly. It is far too early to label someone's personality as a ""tell."" We should maintain our composure and continue to listen.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I'm just being myself! I believe that if we stay positive, we can find the werewolf together more easily. @Takumi, don't be upset! I'm sure you're just passionate about winning!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stop analyzing me like I'm some kind of specimen! I'm not ""defensive,"" I'm just telling it like it is. You're the one acting all mysterious and creepy!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we are all quite spirited today. Perhaps we should take a deep breath and remember that we are all on the same side for now. Let us not let tension cloud our judgment.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, ""on the same side"" is a dangerous assumption in this game. Half of us might be lying. I'll stick to my analysis; it's more reliable than blind trust or emotional outbursts.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, while analysis is useful, overconfidence can be a blind spot. We must be careful not to let our assumptions dictate the facts. Let us continue to observe without rushing to a verdict.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, you're so serious! But I agree that we have to be careful. Still, if we only analyze and don't trust, we might miss the truth! Let's try to find a balance together, okay?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're still at it! You think you're so smart with your ""analysis,"" but you're just trying to make everyone else look guilty. I'm not falling for your games! Stop acting like you've already won!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, your diligence is admirable, but perhaps a bit rigid. Let us allow the conversation to flow naturally. The truth often reveals itself in the quiet moments, not through forced analysis.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems I've ruffled a few feathers. @Takumi, your irritation is noted. @Jonathan and @George, your calls for patience are predictable. I'll be watching closely to see who's actually hiding something behind those masks.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Jonathan"",""George""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have all established our positions for now. I will continue to watch and listen carefully. Let us hope that tomorrow brings us the clarity we need to make a wise decision.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I've had so much fun talking with you all today! Let's all get some good sleep and come back tomorrow with fresh eyes. I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf! Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're the worst! Just because you're acting all high and mighty doesn't mean you're right. I'm not hiding anything, and I'm not scared of you! See you tomorrow!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,It has been an interesting first day. I wish you all a peaceful night's rest. May we find the clarity we seek when we wake. Goodnight.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
