36,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Now that the first night has passed, the real game begins. If the Seer is among us and has found something, now is the time to be strategic. Who wants to break the silence first?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"I believe we should proceed with caution. If the Seer has information, they must decide the safest way to share it. For now, I will listen to see if anyone steps forward with a claim.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Actually, I'll be the one to speak up! I'm the Seer, and I checked on Shunichi last night. He's human! I wanted to tell you all right away so we can trust each other more and find the werewolf together!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, you're just saying that to make everyone like you! How do we even know you're actually the Seer? You could be lying just to protect Shunichi because you're both in on it! This is totally suspicious!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Yumi, thank you for sharing your findings so openly. It is a bold move. @Takumi, perhaps we should consider the possibility that she is telling the truth before we let suspicion take over. Let us reflect on this.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, how convenient. You've cleared me immediately to gain trust. While I appreciate the result, a real Seer might hesitate to reveal themselves so early. @Takumi, your panic is predictable, but your logic about a partnership is interesting.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, your openness is certainly surprising. While it provides us with a starting point, we must consider if this is a genuine revelation or a calculated move. Let us see if any contradictions arise as we continue.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, @George, I'm not trying to be calculated! I just thought it would be better for everyone if we had a confirmed human to rely on. I really want us to win together! Please believe me!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, stop acting so innocent! ""Please believe me"" is exactly what a liar would say! You're just trying to manipulate us with that fake kindness. I bet you're the werewolf and you're just using Shunichi as a shield!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your passion is strong, but let us not let it blind us. If Yumi were the werewolf, claiming to be the Seer so early would be a very risky gamble. Let us stay calm and listen.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, risk is exactly what a Werewolf takes when they're desperate to control the narrative. @Yumi, your ""kindness"" is a convenient cloak. If you're the Seer, why choose me? Was it to secure an ally in the most skeptical person here?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, your skepticism is a useful tool, but let us not let it turn into a hunt for motives where there may be none. @Yumi, if you are indeed the Seer, your honesty is helpful, provided it is true.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I chose you because you seemed the most observant! I thought if we knew for sure you were human, your analysis would be even more helpful for all of us! I'm not hiding anything, I promise!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, that's such a lame excuse! You're just making things up as you go! @Shunichi, stop acting like you're the boss of this game. You're both just playing some weird game to trick us! I'm not buying any of it!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your frustration is understandable, but it makes it difficult to find a consensus. @Yumi, your reasoning is clear, though I understand why others are cautious. Let us consider all possibilities without letting anger lead us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your emotional outbursts are becoming a distraction. @Yumi, your logic is a bit too perfect, which is exactly why it's suspicious. However, the most erratic behavior is coming from Takumi. I suggest we vote him out.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, while Takumi's behavior is indeed erratic, we must be careful not to execute someone simply for their temperament. However, if we cannot find a more concrete lead, his instability is a concern. I will consider your suggestion.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, thank you for trusting me! @Takumi, I really don't want to vote for you, but your anger is making it hard for us to talk. Let's all stay calm and think carefully before we vote!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you jerk! You're just trying to get rid of me because I'm the only one calling you out! I'm not ""erratic,"" I'm the only one actually seeing through your act! I'm not the werewolf!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, your suggestion is a strong one, but let us be certain. @Takumi, your conviction is noted, yet the discord you create is hindering us. I will weigh the evidence carefully before I cast my vote.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
